      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeata Ahabu geenuus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Samariya Ahabu gwandeawa orju laadam ea damanamughuush. Hean ghang'oar Yehu barawajeega, ak goojeakta eayaat Samariya, heeda fuga ambaliischi bea mujiini, ea heeda gweargwa, ea furiischoodiga orjooga Ahabu ak ghang'oardunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas ghoanyaschi barawajeesu, aba gideaba goondeawi orjooga siideang'wa haw, ak goondeawi mutukwajeega ea faraasajeega, ea mujiinajeega sineaweesa ghamarda ea dabita ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aloada siida miyseara daruus aba jeeda orjooga siideang'wa haw, ak goonung' gawa hoorgeeda ghwaan ghoah sugoocheanda, ak goong'uchi aba badayda gheeda siideang'wa haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geabeal muuchi nea geeyi, “Ng'ula, sugoodi iyeenya miighamiinaada aba madeadaanyi, ak abeeda gajeamiinaadaydaan aseasa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siida haw ambal ng'eanyiida ea siida haw ambal mujiini, sea gweargwa ea furiischoodiga, hean geecheaksa Yehu nea geeyeesha, “Aseasa geawooschi fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, ak giliwas sean irugu gajeesna. Ak ea mwajealoada sugoochean nuut, sina giliwas sean idaahi aamiy aba headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'oorsa barawajeandeaba iyeenya nea gwayeesha, “Inyas goondi meatkweedeanyu nea gooleeysean iit abeeda ghoalaji gheata orjooga siideang'wa haw, ak numuji gooyeanean damanda uurji nih aba hiji bea Yesreeliin.” Ak orju laadam ea damanamughuush bea sugoocheanda goobiita gealga fuga hees bea mujiini ghayi arear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahita barawajeanda heanyaawa, hean geang'waay orjooga sugoocheanda ak geenuuseada. Nea mooneeda nyaawa ea sagalam ea damanamughuush ak geeyiinaada iheenga nyaawa jeesinga sooscheeka amang'ata geayaat Yesreeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu siida siicheagu ak gwayeesha, “Siyeadu iheenga orjoogiga bea sugoocheandean.” Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Anung' ghoah gheamughuushcheeka iyeenya ak ghoayiinyi gheata dooshta ea ghoah sakteayda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sakteayda gwarita jarooda ak ghamiinaada, ak goobalool buuneesean nea gwayeesha, “Agooga ghoawooschi fuga doobiiweadi, ang'ula aniini ghaang'uchi foolayda aba badayda siideanyu haw ak geanuuschi ak ghamneawa siida bwar fiisu seaniin ng'eaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi anala gideaba ng'asheega sean ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda gheeh Ahabu nisa. Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gwasin suh ruguun aba ghuuta Eliya was siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwar Yehu fuga sean was boosteanga gheeh Ahabu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Yesreeli, ak ghabwar eara fuga hees sean, ea fugaaschi duupchi sean ea ashoohoodigaaschi, ak ea manung' ghoabit eara siyagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geebwar fuga dooshta Ahasi was sugoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwanda Yehu naweeda gawa ng'eanyiida Samariya. Nea gwaneekiisa heeda siguura museasooda jeagiischoodiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwaroonyi Yehu sea fuga gheeh Ahasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Goowooschi geabeang'a?” Geeyeesha, “Aseasa geawooschi orjooga geenyea Ahasiya ghamneawa geerarang'aadi eeweaya bareanyeeka aba gheeh sugoocheanda, nea geekeacheewi orjooga gatmooda sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha fugaaschi, “Oang'waanya fiisu nea gudea majeekcheewi.” Hean geang'waay ak geenuuseada aba heeda neekeewa museasooda jeagiischoodiga, fih haradam ea iyeenya ak ea manda dea siipuut earagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boosteanga sean bea gheeh Ahabu geenuus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghang'eada hoowa, gwaroonyi sea Yehonadabu was orjeeda Rekabu. Nea abeeda ghwahidu roonyeadaanyi, ak googeachi niny nea gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i ea aniini ghaaghanyi geewuurji. Abwaara gayweadaani?” Ghwalamda Yehonadabu ak gwayeesha, “Gaydaweanyi.” Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Ada abeeda gigooni geatindaang'u.” Ghoadayda geatindaanyi. Hean ghoang'waay Yehu geatindaanyi ak goodiing'da uhuuda mutukwajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Eani geeshteanyu ak gaydaaha gidaalachti ghuut aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA.” Hean goodeayi sean nea geenda jeeda mutuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sihita ng'eanyiida Samariya ghabwar Yehu boosteanga sean bea gheeh Ahabu aba Samariya. Ak ghwalas uhuuda gawuurji gidabaloolda NG'UTAMIIDA Eliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geenuuseada fuga bada sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat Yehu buuneesean ak gwayeesha, “Ahabu ghayi gagadiiyeesa Baali gilimwanang', ak Yehu gaygagadiyeesa muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aguursiina sibanga sean bea Baali, ea gea bada niny sean, ea ashoohoodigaaschi sean, adeapuut eara siyagi. Aba gideaba geandeawi dahaabu hees siguura dahaabu jea daadaw Baali, ak siida mwahina maygoobiida badayda ng'eanyiida.” Ak Yehu aba seareani gwasin fughareeda gagasa ghwalas uhuuda gea bada Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Oatawa iita buuneeda ghapka ghabwat Baali.” Hean geatayda iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Yehu eeguursa buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida Israeli ak ghapka fuga sean bada Baali nea meapuuda eara siyagi. Ak geeweay jeeda gheeda Baali ak ghwanyiit gheeda ea gwasku gidaghuuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yehu ashoohoocheandida ambal hang'weaka heeda ghaydidiin. “Adawa hang'weaka fuga bada Baali.” Ak ghoadaw hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Yehu sea Yehonadabu orjeeda Rekabu jeeda gheeda ak gwayeesha fuga bwat Baali, “Asikteawana aba jeedeang'wa ea gwanda siida gadiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA, anung' eaghus gea bada Baali gabeachi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeweay gah eatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. Abeeda Yehu aba jarooda gwandeawa fih seedam, nea niyeesha, “Inyas ghaghu eara siyagi aba fuga naayiinyi geatingeagwa siida siksa abeeda gajeabwar niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea siihiit haleanjeeda sisabwa geat bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. Gwayeesha Yehu furiischoocheanda ea fuga hees, “Asi aweayeena gah ak ghoabwarji, nea adagwarita eara siyagi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeweay ak geabwar aba ng'uta furiischoodiga nea shirikarajeega hees ak geejaksa jarooda, ak geeweay ea eahita gheeda Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geejaksa jarooda daraneeda mida jeeda gheeda Baali, ak geaghwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gidaghayi geandeayda Yehu ghadooweeda Baali gil aba ng'eanyiida Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yehu ea mii ghwanung'waada riing'eega sin Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati nung' goodiiy fuga Israeli aba badita meayda dahaabu siguura dahaabu bea ng'eanyiida Beteli ea Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Yehu, “Aba gideaba nisini gea miyaasiin ak ea nidoabiiw aba madeedeanyu. Aba gideaba gisimi gheeh Ahabu ng'asheega sean mida jeedeanyu, asi orjoagaagu bea jeateaba ang'wan gaygoombaliischi aba ng'eanyiida Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yehu ea mwaang'waanya muuchi deaweedeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli aba jeeda gurooroadaanyi sean. Ak ea miighwanung'waada riing'eega Yeroboamu, ghayi nung' gwasin fuga Israeli riing'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Yehu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba damandida ghwasuuy NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli. Ak ghabwar fuga Israeli sugoocheanda Shaamu was Hasaeli aba moonghajeega sean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada Yordani bea meatkweeda ghayeawa ea ghwahita ng'eanyiisean bea Gileyadi, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Gadi, ea gea Rubeni ea Manase. Ghang'eada Aroeri nea Gileyadi gil ea Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Yehu, ea sinaweega sean, ea meaynataanyi sean neada ea miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Yehu ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi aba ng'eanyiida Samariya. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Yehoahasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yehu niimbal fuga Israeli aba Samariya gweanyeew diktam ea sis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
